{"type":"record","name":"StrikeInvasionWallFrame","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.strikeinvasion","doc":"One liquidity-heatmap frame reduced to what the shadow wall lookup reads: the scope fields and its CALL cells. A frame with no cells is still a frame: it invalidates every earlier one. Internal evidence record of strike-invasion-service: it crosses a Kafka repartition topic (and, per strike, a state-store changelog) declared by that service, never a public contract.","fields":[{"name":"symbol","type":"string"},{"name":"expiry","type":"string","doc":"Empty when the source stated none."},{"name":"bucketStartMs","type":"long","doc":"The frame's bucketStartMs, else the record time."},{"name":"cells","type":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"record","name":"StrikeInvasionWallCell","doc":"One CALL cell of a heatmap frame.","fields":[{"name":"strike","type":{"type":"bytes","logicalType":"decimal","precision":38,"scale":18}},{"name":"lastAskSize","type":"long"}]}}}]}